Package: adassault
Version: 0.0.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: ruby, build-essential
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://noraj.github.io/ADAssault/
Description: Active Directory penetration testing tool
 ADAssault is a Ruby gem for pentesting Active Directory environments,
 complementing tools like NetExec. It provides various modules and
 utilities for AD reconnaissance and exploitation.
